WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.703 --> 00:00:13.963
Roxy glanced at her friends.

2
00:00:13.983 --> 00:00:15.964
"Oh no!"

3
00:00:16.284 --> 00:00:16.704
she said.

4
00:00:16.724 --> 00:00:18.084
"What's wrong?"

5
00:00:18.405 --> 00:00:19.025
asked Mara.

6
00:00:19.045 --> 00:00:22.766
"I forgot a book at the library," said Roxy.

7
00:00:22.786 --> 00:00:24.526
"You all go home.

8
00:00:25.126 --> 00:00:26.227
I'll take the next bus."

9
00:00:28.487 --> 00:00:30.288
Roxy ran down the crowded sidewalk.

10
00:00:31.420 --> 00:00:32.741
"Wait!" called Terrell.

11
00:00:33.521 --> 00:00:35.122
"We can help find the book!"

12
00:00:36.362 --> 00:00:37.923
But Roxy was already gone.

13
00:00:37.943 --> 00:00:41.764
"Look! It's Rocket Girl!"

14
00:00:41.985 --> 00:00:42.585
cried Mara.

15
00:00:43.545 --> 00:00:46.767
Swoosh! Roxy zoomed across the sky.

16
00:00:47.687 --> 00:00:49.148
She flew right to the car show.

17
00:00:51.689 --> 00:00:53.870
The front doors of the convention center were shattered.

18
00:00:54.670 --> 00:00:56.291
Bits of glass lay everywhere.

19
00:00:57.431 --> 00:00:59.452
Several cars in the parking lot were smashed.

20
00:01:00.608 --> 00:01:02.589
Detective Smith stood near the shattered doors.

21
00:01:04.090 --> 00:01:06.152
He was talking to Mayor Bloom and some other people.

22
00:01:07.453 --> 00:01:08.694
One man wore a lab coat.

23
00:01:09.694 --> 00:01:11.736
Roxy landed next to the detective and grinned.

24
00:01:11.756 --> 00:01:15.238
"Shopping for a new car, Detective?"

25
00:01:15.258 --> 00:01:20.021
"This is no time for jokes," said the detective.

26
00:01:20.041 --> 00:01:23.423
"Car theft is a serious crime."

27
00:01:24.704 --> 00:01:27.986
"It isn't just any car," said the man in the lab coat.

28
00:01:28.847 --> 00:01:30.048
"It's the Ultra Car!"

29
00:01:31.648 --> 00:01:33.749
"Why is it called the Ultra Car?"

30
00:01:33.909 --> 00:01:34.649
Roxy asked.

31
00:01:35.430 --> 00:01:37.751
"It's the most amazing car ever invented!"

32
00:01:37.991 --> 00:01:38.571
said the man.

33
00:01:38.591 --> 00:01:40.992
"It's as tough as an army tank.

34
00:01:41.772 --> 00:01:42.953
It has lasers.

35
00:01:43.673 --> 00:01:46.414
It can go under water and even fly!"

36
00:01:47.775 --> 00:01:48.515
Roxy gulped.

37
00:01:49.656 --> 00:01:51.396
The car could do all of those things.

38
00:01:52.637 --> 00:01:55.358
And now a thief had it This was bad news.

39
00:01:55.378 --> 00:01:58.739
"Did anyone see who stole it?"

40
00:01:59.000 --> 00:01:59.760
Roxy asked.

41
00:02:00.680 --> 00:02:01.841
The inventor shook his head.

42
00:02:02.722 --> 00:02:03.743
Mayor Bloom did too.

43
00:02:05.384 --> 00:02:06.345
A woman rushed over.

44
00:02:07.606 --> 00:02:08.887
She wore lots of diamonds.

45
00:02:08.907 --> 00:02:12.190
"I know who took the car," she said.

46
00:02:13.331 --> 00:02:14.452
Roxy recognized her.

47
00:02:16.033 --> 00:02:19.236
She was Victoria Cash, the richest woman in Metro City.

48
00:02:19.256 --> 00:02:22.218
"You know who the thief is?"

49
00:02:22.458 --> 00:02:23.059
said Roxy.

50
00:02:23.079 --> 00:02:24.360
"Who is it?"

51
00:02:25.661 --> 00:02:27.803
Mrs. Cash dabbed her eyes with a handkerchief.

52
00:02:29.736 --> 00:02:31.797
"It wasn't a thief," she said.

53
00:02:31.817 --> 00:02:34.698
"It was my daughter, Ruby."

54
00:02:34.718 --> 00:02:39.140
"Why would Ruby steal a car?"

55
00:02:39.460 --> 00:02:40.381
asked Detective Smith.

56
00:02:40.401 --> 00:02:43.622
"She didn't mean to," said Mrs.

57
00:02:43.662 --> 00:02:48.204
Cash. "She wanted to ride in the Ultra Car, but I told her no."

58
00:02:49.684 --> 00:02:50.285
She sighed.

59
00:02:50.305 --> 00:02:53.586
"Ruby doesn't like to hear the word 'no.'"

60
00:02:53.606 --> 00:02:58.088
"Ruby sounds a little spoiled," thought Roxy.

61
00:02:59.180 --> 00:03:01.561
"I just turned my back for a moment," Mrs.

62
00:03:01.621 --> 00:03:02.401
Cash went on.

63
00:03:03.502 --> 00:03:05.463
"Ruby must have gotten into the car.

64
00:03:06.543 --> 00:03:08.524
A moment later the car took off!"

65
00:03:10.445 --> 00:03:11.726
Detective Smith's phone rang.

66
00:03:12.686 --> 00:03:14.247
"Smith here," the detective said.

67
00:03:14.267 --> 00:03:17.688
"Really? Oh no!"

68
00:03:18.869 --> 00:03:20.830
He put his phone away and looked at Roxy.

69
00:03:20.850 --> 00:03:25.892
"The Ultra Car is destroying downtown Metro City!"
